0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTKvq-X5SFU-WThwYWR5HmxYJPHhpwPaA6hVRWolXg3nA&oe=6AF1E30B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "16-10.png", "id": "8512037645577760", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75395599_8512037655577759_1169937139310052534_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AWHOIIPlZawQ7kNvwEUS3OU&_nc_oc=AdoQYQ4-I-5aMk4B4LPdYGwe44iw9WviapWWRP2r8P19FluDTrsWxG0QA4DedEGuYx0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQtU23gWCTFLv6XgLBD9kA1vF524JKuBdmnYO6axzlIXg&oe=6AF1F03A"}, "display_name": "Moviola Video Editor", "keywords": ["video", "editor", "editing", "moviola", "film"], "long_description": "# Moviola: Your Video Editing solution on your Meta Quest\n\nMoviola is a mixed reality, immersive multi-track video editor built exclusively for Meta Quest devices. Use your hands or controllers to grab, trim, and arrange clips in 3D space, no desktop required.\n\n# Languages:\n- English\n- Spanish\n- German\n- French\n- Portuguese\n\n{8632676920173149}\n- Multi-track editing with ripple delete, overwrite, and slip modes  \n{522080987190953}\n- Import, preview, edit, and export. All in one seamless VR workflow\n\n# Main Features:\n- Edit 360\u00b0, 180\u00b0, 3D (SBS, TB), and standard 2D videos\n- Drag and drop clips into a multi-track timeline\n- View edits in passthrough, theater, or living room modes\n- Record voice-overs directly into your project\n- Organize media visually using interactive 3D reels\n- Auto-save and fast export to local storage\n\n**Supported Formats:**\n- Input: MP4 (H.264 & H.265 up to 8K, MPEG-4 Layer-2 up to 1080p), WAV, MP3, OGG\n- Export: MP4 (1080p, MPEG-4 Layer-2 + AAC), up to 60 fps\n- Layouts: 2D, 3D SBS/TB, 360\u00b0/180\u00b0 mono & stereo\n\n**Important:** Moviola is under active development. Try it, send feedback, and help shape the future of VR video editing!\n\nThis app uses FFmpeg under GPLv3 for high 